  description: "A mechanical paint thickness gauge is a simple, manual tool used
    to measure the thickness of paint or coatings on metal surfaces. It usually works
    with a spring-loaded probe and provides approximate readings. It\u2019s cost-effective
    and does not require batteries but is less precise than digital models."
